<section id="security" aria-labelledby="password-heading">
  <h2 id="password-heading" class="h">
    PASSWORD <br class="br" />
    GENERATOR
  </h2>
  <div class="security-box">
    <div class="intro-pass">
      <i class="fas fa-lock lock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <p class="esp">
        Aquí les dejo el generador de contraseñas por si les es útil. Pueden generarlas las veces
        que quieran y tendrán integrado el botón para copiarla.
      </p>
      <p class="eng">
        Here I leave the password generator in case it is useful, you can generate as many times as
        you want and you will have the button integrated to copy it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="passGenerator">
      <span id="input-pass" role="status" aria-live="polite">Password</span>
      <br />
      <p id="timer">10</p>
      <button type="button" id="generate">
        <i class="fas fa-key" aria-hidden="true"></i> Generate
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="btn-copy" id="btn-copy">
        <i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i> Copy
      </button>
      <i class="fas fa-check check" id="check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <i class="fas fa-times" id="close" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initPassword } from "../scripts/password";
  initPassword();
</script>
